/T31n1604_p0625c01","n":"0625c","t":"續欲作斷苦無差別故四者不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0626a01","n":"0626a","t":"無義自我滅大義依大我釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0626b01","n":"0626b","t":"希有非希有他利自利故釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0626c01","n":"0626c","t":"所為答但為利群生如此等事"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0627a01","n":"0627a","t":"譬如大地種任持四種物如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0627b01","n":"0627b","t":"釋曰此偈顯示菩薩清淨業方"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0627c01","n":"0627c","t":"數唯有六初為攝利他三事故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0628a01","n":"0628a","t":"中檀波羅蜜於諸資財不著為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0628b01","n":"0628b","t":"作業者隨欲助之定於學定者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0628c01","n":"0628c","t":"便依止五者勢力依止物依止"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0629a01","n":"0629a","t":"一身復有恒河沙數劫壽一一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0629b01","n":"0629b","t":"大乘莊嚴經論卷第八無著菩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0629c01","n":"0629c","t":"心住因戒得故持等者是戒業"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0630a01","n":"0630a","t":"精進因由信及求精進得起故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0630b01","n":"0630b","t":"者是慧相應如經中說般若者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0630c01","n":"0630c","t":"恒時捨身命離求愍他故因施"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0631a01","n":"0631a","t":"無上菩提故偈曰恒時習諸定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0631b01","n":"0631b","t":"生喜三求見求遂時生喜由不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0631c01","n":"0631c","t":"熟他而作綺語是故菩薩能極"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0632a01","n":"0632a","t":"菩薩禪翻彼者謂翻彼三人禪"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0632b01","n":"0632b","t":"望思惟所說依止三昧者謂依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0632c01","n":"0632c","t":"釋曰乞者所須菩薩皆施乞者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0633a01","n":"0633a","t":"一得現法樂住二得世間法三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0633b01","n":"0633b","t":"於小利及大利故何以故為自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0633c01","n":"0633c","t":"布施將愛語利行并同利施平"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0634a01","n":"0634a","t":"一所緣法二所行法三所淨法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0634b01","n":"0634b","t":"大乘莊嚴經論卷第八大乘莊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0634c01","n":"0634c","t":"田供養眾生為田教彼供養令"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0635a01","n":"0635a","t":"一味心二隨喜心三希望心四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0635b01","n":"0635b","t":"應緣起親近亦有三種一者願"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0635c01","n":"0635c","t":"親近為遠復次生報趣中親近"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0636a01","n":"0636a","t":"聚慈者於求樂眾生聚起與樂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0636b01","n":"0636b","t":"法忍菩薩故如所說下翻此下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0636c01","n":"0636c","t":"釋曰此偈顯示得六種呵責過"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0637a01","n":"0637a","t":"修善時為魔障礙者三是苦逼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0637b01","n":"0637b","t":"曰見苦自性時知苦生悲苦亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0637c01","n":"0637c","t":"云何答此樹以大悲為根以忍"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0638a01","n":"0638a","t":"於苦勝樂生樂生由悲故釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0638b01","n":"0638b","t":"者彼初謂信行地菩薩彼於起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0638c01","n":"0638c","t":"釋曰悲施財三果悲者恒增長"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0639a01","n":"0639a","t":"不受有願還以施者若我施果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0639b01","n":"0639b","t":"無障及淨句利彼亦自量無求"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0639c01","n":"0639c","t":"善法不勤行故緣著者五欲亂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1604_p0640a01","n":"0640a","t":"大乘莊嚴經論卷